# Build artifacts - explicit patterns for better compatibility
**/bin
**/obj
**/out
**/publish
bin/
obj/
out/
publish/

# IDE and editors
**/.vs
.vs/
**/.git
.git/
**/.idea
.idea/
**/.vscode
.vscode/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# NuGet
**/packages
packages/

# Test results
**/TestResults
TestResults/
**/*.trx

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs
logs/

# Documentation
**/*.md
LICENSE
docs/

# Tests (not needed in production image)
**/*Tests/
**/tests/

# Misc
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
**/*.bak
*.tmp

# Kubernetes manifests
k8s/
helm/

# Local settings
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/*.local.json

# NuGet config with Windows paths
**/nuget.config
**/NuGet.Config
**/*.nuget.props
**/*.nuget.targets
